{
 "slug": "cattle-handling-equipment-every-farm-should-have",
 "title": "Essential Cattle Handling Equipment Every Farm Should Have",
 "h1": "Essential Cattle Handling Equipment Every Farm Should Have",
 "desc": "Explore essential cattle handling equipment every farm needs for safer livestock, smoother workflows, and more efficient daily operations.",
 "excerpt": "Good cattle handling starts long before an animal reaches a chute or sorting pen. It begins with the way your entire setup works together. The right cattle handling…",
